+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "markdown",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "source": [
+    "## 5. Open image to be classified\n",
+    "Download a JPEG image of a deer and place it in a valid directory. The image can then be loaded and displayed through the notebook."
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "code",
+   "execution_count": 5,
+   "metadata": {},
+   "outputs": [
+    {
+     "data": {
+      "image/png": "\n",
